  "title": "Scripps Sports, Nashville Predators partner on multi-year agreement to air National Hockey League team’s games",
  "summary": "NASHVILLE and CINCINNATI – The Nashville Predators and Scripps Sports have created a landmark multi-year media rights agreement that brings free, over-the-air access to the Predators’ National Hockey League games to fans across Middle Tennessee and beyond beginning with the 2026–27 NHL season.",
